## Third-party notices

This project's avatar artwork is derived from MIT-licensed work by others. MIT requires the copyright
notice and permission text to travel with the software, so both upstream notices are reproduced here.
They are recorded in this file rather than in `NOTICE` because `bun run forge` generates `NOTICE` from
the Iconify attribution chain and empties it when no Apache-2.0 set is in use — a notice placed there
would be deleted by the next build.

See `recipes/avataaarsStudy/LICENCE.md` for the full provenance chain and for exactly which pieces come
from where.

